---
title: Brandy Crusta
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, brandy]
source: Classic cocktail, number 38 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

Wet the rim of a small #wine glass{} with lemon, dip it in @superfine sugar{}, and curl a long @lemon peel{1}(cut in one spiral) inside the glass. In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @brandy{2%fl_oz}, @orange curaçao{0.25%fl_oz}, @maraschino liqueur{1%tsp}, @lemon juice{0.5%fl_oz}, @simple syrup{1%tsp} and @Angostura bitters{1%dash}. Shake briskly for ~{10%seconds}, and strain into the glass.

> From New Orleans in the 1850s, and the ancestor of the Sidecar.
